{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>When they lifted their hands</b> — from the root עלל, and like it: ועוללתי בעפר קרני (Job 16:15), and it has the same meaning as the form מעל from עלה and ויעל, and these are two roots in one meaning, like שוגג and משגה." "And he explained במועל — as in the lifting of their hands, in the sense of: Lift up your hands in holiness and bless YHWH (Psalms 134:2)."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:20.807753994Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}